{"about_the_game":"&quot;Yasai Game&quot; is a falling object puzzle game that incorporates physics calculations. Players can evolve yasais by dropping different types of yasais into boxes and making them come into contact with each other. A total of 24 types of yasais appear, and the game can be cleared by making the cabbages and pumpkins touch each other.<br><br>A characteristic mechanic of the game is that combos occur when yasais evolve in a short period of time, and by making combos happen continuously, &quot;helper&quot; appear that are advantageous for gameplay. This helper character will stir up the Yasais in the box, giving you a chance to turn the game around once and for all.<br><br>&quot;Yasai Game&quot; has a time attack element where you aim to clear the game in a short time, a high score element where you aim to get the highest score, and a challenge element where you compete to see how far you can evolve your yasais. These can be competed on online leaderboards.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2846980/extras/b45a04e4a05ac5663f3ccc0857eff359.avif?t=1712478234\" width=600 height=480 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"harvest a lot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2846980/7443b12480833525d21b036aa221dbc47f130caf.jpg"},{"name":"Fuuta do your best","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2846980/7e073f3697f8c09a74a6561a5278967b3cde34de.jpg"},{"name":"Fuuka Onegai","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2846980/580010486c1f5625ff5f8ff5656e9ac40193b315.jpg"},{"name":"Big cheering group","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2846980/64df47062f1b77f86fdbf239a0c0a7a7718fbb1a.jpg"},{"name":"Perfect harvest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2846980